			"<p><strong>Recommended for</strong></p><list><item>short-lived test sites</item><item>sites that will be cloned back to production after testing</item></list><p><strong>Please note</strong> that staying in Safe mode will disable some Jetpack features, including security features such as SSO, firewall, and site monitor. <safeModeLink>Learn more</safeModeLink>.</p>": [
